<title>POLAND: Warta rebounds after accidental fall.</title>
<headline>Warta rebounds after accidental fall.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish insurance firm Warta SA rose 9.1 percent to 54 zlotys in a moderate turnover, after unexpectedly falling 10 percent on Tuesday, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;The rebound is a natural reaction after yesterday's fall, which was quite accidental,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
